<Item XName="Eqns" Type="Equation">
<Text>% --------------------------------------------------------------------------&#x000D;&#x000A;% SamplesPerSymbol: Sets the number of sampler per symbol.&#x000D;&#x000A;%                   It MUST be a POSITIVE integer.&#x000D;&#x000A;%&#x000D;&#x000A;% StartUpDelay: Sets the number of startup samples that will be removed.&#x000D;&#x000A;%               It MUST be a POSITIVE integer.&#x000D;&#x000A;%               In addition, it sets the downsampling phase and so it must&#x000D;&#x000A;%               be carefully selected to downsample the input signal at the&#x000D;&#x000A;%               optimal sampling instant.&#x000D;&#x000A;% --------------------------------------------------------------------------&#x000D;&#x000A;&#x000D;&#x000A;% --------------------------------------------------------------------------&#x000D;&#x000A;% ENTER DESIRED GRAPH CHARACTERISTICS HERE&#x000D;&#x000A;&#x000D;&#x000A;SamplesPerSymbol = 1;&#x000D;&#x000A;StartUpDelay = 1;&#x000D;&#x000A;&#x000D;&#x000A;% END CHANGES&#x000D;&#x000A;% --------------------------------------------------------------------------&#x000D;&#x000A;&#x000D;&#x000A;% Reset variables to default if they are out of bounds&#x000D;&#x000A;&#x000D;&#x000A;if ( SamplesPerSymbol &lt; 1 )&#x000D;&#x000A;&#x0009;SamplesPerSymbol = 8;&#x000D;&#x000A;end&#x000D;&#x000A;&#x000D;&#x000A;if ( StartUpDelay &lt; 1 )&#x000D;&#x000A;&#x0009;StartUpDelay = 49;&#x000D;&#x000A;end&#x000D;&#x000A;&#x000D;&#x000A;using(&apos;Ref_LTE_DL_EVM2&apos;);&#x000D;&#x000A;&#x000D;&#x000A;PSS_Lyr0 = L1_Layer0PSSConst( StartUpDelay:SamplesPerSymbol:end );&#x000D;&#x000A;</Text>
