<Item XName="Note" UserName="Note" Type="Notes">
<Selected><T>Bool</T><D>0</D></Selected>
<Text>&lt;FONT size=2&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/FONT&gt; &#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P class=MsoTitle style=&quot;BORDER-TOP: medium none; BORDER-RIGHT: medium none; BORDER-BOTTOM: windowtext 0.75pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1pt; PADDING-TOP: 0in; PADDING-LEFT: 0in; BORDER-LEFT: medium none; MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 0in&quot; align=center&gt;&lt;FONT size=5 face=Arial&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&quot;FONT-SIZE: 18pt; FONT-FAMILY: Arial&quot;&gt;&lt;STRONG&gt;3GPP_LTE_DL_TxEVM&lt;/STRONG&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P class=MsoBodyText style=&quot;MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt&quot; align=center&gt;&lt;FONT size=2&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&quot;FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: Arial; mso-bidi-font-size: 12.0pt&quot;&gt;Keysight Technologies SystemVue Example Workspace&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&quot;FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 12.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;?xml:namespace prefix = &quot;o&quot; /&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P class=MsoNormal style=&quot;TEXT-ALIGN: center; MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt&quot; align=center&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&quot;FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 12.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;FONT face=&quot;Times New Roman&quot;&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/P&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&quot;FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 12.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;FONT face=&quot;Times New Roman&quot;&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P class=MsoNormal style=&quot;TEXT-ALIGN: left; MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt&quot; align=left&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&quot;FONT-SIZE: 10pt&quot;&gt;This&amp;nbsp;example workspace&amp;nbsp;demonstrates&amp;nbsp;EVM measurements&amp;nbsp;for an LTE&amp;nbsp;downlink transmitter with different&amp;nbsp;transmit antennas. There are&amp;nbsp;2 folders in this workspace:&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;UL&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;LI&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;DIV class=MsoNormal style=&quot;TEXT-ALIGN: left; MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt&quot; align=left&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&quot;FONT-SIZE: 10pt&quot;&gt;&lt;FONT face=Arial&gt;LTE DL EVM Measurement1: provides EVM measurements for a&amp;nbsp;1 antenna system.&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/DIV&gt;&lt;/LI&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;LI&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;DIV class=MsoNormal style=&quot;TEXT-ALIGN: left; MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt&quot; align=left&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&quot;FONT-SIZE: 10pt&quot;&gt;&lt;FONT face=Arial&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;DIV class=MsoNormal style=&quot;TEXT-ALIGN: left; MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt&quot; align=left&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&quot;FONT-SIZE: 10pt&quot;&gt;&lt;FONT face=Arial&gt;LTE DL EVM Measurement2: provides EVM measurements for a 2 antenna system.&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/DIV&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/DIV&gt;&lt;/LI&gt;&lt;/UL&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&quot;FONT-SIZE: 10pt&quot;&gt;&lt;FONT face=Arial&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;DIV class=MsoNormal style=&quot;TEXT-ALIGN: left; MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt&quot; align=left&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&quot;FONT-SIZE: 10pt&quot;&gt;The available results from these measurements including:&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/DIV&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;UL&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;LI&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;DIV class=MsoNormal style=&quot;TEXT-ALIGN: left; MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt&quot; align=left&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&quot;FONT-SIZE: 10pt&quot;&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P&gt;&lt;FONT size=2&gt;The&amp;nbsp;information about the quality of the signal being analyzed , such as EVM, EVMPk, DataEVM, SyncCorr and so on. &lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/DIV&gt;&lt;/LI&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;LI&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;DIV class=MsoNormal style=&quot;TEXT-ALIGN: left; MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt&quot; align=left&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&quot;FONT-SIZE: 10pt&quot;&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&quot;FONT-SIZE: 10pt&quot;&gt;Separate measurements and display for user channels and signals: P-SS, S-SS, PBCH, PCFICH, PHICH, PDCCH&amp;nbsp;and&amp;nbsp;PDSCH.&lt;/P&gt;&lt;/DIV&gt;&lt;/LI&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;LI&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;DIV class=MsoNormal style=&quot;TEXT-ALIGN: left; MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt&quot; align=left&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&quot;FONT-SIZE: 10pt&quot;&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P&gt;&lt;FONT size=2&gt;Constellation&amp;nbsp;for all channels (re-run to display these data).&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/DIV&gt;&lt;/LI&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;LI&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;DIV class=MsoNormal style=&quot;TEXT-ALIGN: left; MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt&quot; align=left&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&quot;FONT-SIZE: 10pt&quot;&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P&gt;&lt;FONT size=2&gt;Normalized equalizer channel frequency response over subcarriers.&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/DIV&gt;&lt;/LI&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;LI&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;DIV class=MsoNormal style=&quot;TEXT-ALIGN: left; MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt&quot; align=left&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&quot;FONT-SIZE: 10pt&quot;&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P&gt;&lt;FONT size=2&gt;&lt;SPAN class=menu&gt;RB Error Mag Spectrum &lt;/SPAN&gt;shows the EVM of each resource block (RB) in the selected layer.&lt;/FONT&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/P&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/DIV&gt;&lt;/LI&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;LI&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;DIV class=MsoNormal style=&quot;TEXT-ALIGN: left; MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt&quot; align=left&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&quot;FONT-SIZE: 10pt&quot;&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P&gt;&lt;FONT size=2&gt;Measured&amp;nbsp;MIMO Information in MIMO case.&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&lt;/DIV&gt;&lt;/LI&gt;&lt;/UL&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;DIV class=MsoNormal style=&quot;TEXT-ALIGN: left; MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt&quot; align=left&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&quot;FONT-SIZE: 10pt&quot;&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/DIV&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;DIV class=MsoNormal style=&quot;TEXT-ALIGN: left; MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt&quot; align=left&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&quot;FONT-SIZE: 10pt&quot;&gt;The EVM model support 1, 2 and 4 transmit antennas system measurement. The algorithm that&amp;nbsp;performs the synchronization, demodulation and EVM analysis in the EVM&amp;nbsp;model is the same as the one used in Keysight 89600 VSA.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/DIV&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;DIV class=MsoNormal style=&quot;TEXT-ALIGN: left; MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt&quot; align=left&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&quot;FONT-SIZE: 10pt&quot;&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/DIV&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;DIV class=MsoNormal style=&quot;TEXT-ALIGN: left; MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt&quot; align=left&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&quot;FONT-SIZE: 10pt&quot;&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/DIV&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;DIV class=MsoNormal style=&quot;TEXT-ALIGN: left; MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt&quot; align=left&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&quot;FONT-SIZE: 10pt&quot;&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&quot;FONT-SIZE: 10pt&quot;&gt;&lt;FONT face=Arial&gt;&lt;STRONG&gt;NOTE&lt;/STRONG&gt;: For visibility of graph Constellation and RBErrorMagSpectrum, SaveConstelltion setup for EVM model should be YES. Otherwise errors might be seen in Error Window due to unavailability of the data to be plotted in these graphs. The workspace and EVM measurements, however, will still be working.&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/DIV&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;</Text>
